### ==========================================================
### BUDGETS — CRUD, budget GLOBAL, períodos, spent, overrides,
### effectiveFrom, expiración de CUSTOM, archivar y restaurar
### El view trae: type, currency, archivedCategoryIds, hasOverride,
### expired, effectiveFrom, createdAt/updatedAt.
### ==========================================================
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@email = tester@test.com
@password = SecureP@ss123

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###

@token = {{login.response.body.accessToken}}

### Categoría del budget (type debe ser compatible con el del budget)
# @name cat
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "BudgetCat {{$randomInt 100 999}}", "type": "EXPENSE" }

###

@catId = {{cat.response.body.id}}

### ---------- Éxito ----------

### Crear budget mensual por categoría (éxito)
# @name budget
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Comida",
  "color": "RED",
  "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"],
  "amount": 500,
  "periodType": "MONTHLY",
  "note": "límite mensual"
}

###

@budgetId = {{budget.response.body.id}}

### Budget GLOBAL — categoryIds: [] = TODO el gasto del período
### (los quick-adds sin categoría cuentan aquí desde el segundo cero)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Total del mes", "color": "GRAY", "categoryIds": [], "amount": 3000, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }

### Meta de INGRESO (backend-ready; el front MVP no la expone)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Meta facturación", "color": "GREEN", "categoryIds": [], "type": "INCOME", "amount": 5000, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }

### Budget con effectiveFrom backdateado — "existe" desde julio
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Comida semanal", "color": "TEAL", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 150, "periodType": "WEEKLY", "effectiveFrom": "2026-07-01T00:00:00.000Z" }

### Listar budgets (spent del período actual)
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar para un mes pasado (reference) — los budgets que aún no
### "existían" (effectiveFrom/createdAt posteriores) NO aparecen
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets?reference=2026-07-15T12:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get por id
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Update (éxito) — cambiar periodType LIMPIA los overrides y fechas CUSTOM
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 600, "color": "AMBER" }

### Override del monto del período actual (hasOverride pasa a true)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}/amount
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 800 }

### Override en 0 — "este período no aplica"
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}/amount
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 0 }

### QUITAR el override — vuelve al baseAmount (hasOverride vuelve a false)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}/amount
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Budget CUSTOM (ventana fija; expira al pasar periodEndDate)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Viaje",
  "color": "BLUE",
  "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"],
  "amount": 1000,
  "periodType": "CUSTOM",
  "periodStartDate": "2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "periodEndDate": "2026-06-15T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Segundo CUSTOM sobre la MISMA categoría con ventana que no se toca (201):
### los CUSTOM solo chocan si sus fechas se intersectan
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Viaje diciembre",
  "color": "BLUE",
  "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"],
  "amount": 1000,
  "periodType": "CUSTOM",
  "periodStartDate": "2026-12-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "periodEndDate": "2026-12-31T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### CUSTOM que se solapa con "Viaje" (400 BUDGET_PERIOD_OVERLAP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Viaje solapado",
  "color": "RED",
  "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"],
  "amount": 500,
  "periodType": "CUSTOM",
  "periodStartDate": "2026-06-10T00:00:00.000Z",
  "periodEndDate": "2026-06-20T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### Los CUSTOM expirados salen del listado por defecto; verlos:
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets?includeExpired=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Archivar (soft delete, idempotente) — se puede restaurar más abajo
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ver archivados
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets?includeArchived=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Restaurar un budget archivado — conserva overrides, effectiveFrom y categorías.
### Idempotente. Si otro activo ya cubre esas categorías en ese período: 400
### BUDGET_PERIOD_OVERLAP (no se restaura; el usuario crea uno nuevo).
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- Casos de error ----------

### Duplicado — misma categoría + mismo tipo de período + mismo type (400 BUDGET_PERIOD_OVERLAP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Comida dup", "color": "GREEN", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 400, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }

### Segundo budget GLOBAL del mismo período (400 BUDGET_PERIOD_OVERLAP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Total dup", "color": "GRAY", "categoryIds": [], "amount": 100, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }

### Categoría inexistente/ajena (404 Category not found)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "color": "RED", "categoryIds": ["00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"], "amount": 100, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }

### Custom sin fechas (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bad custom", "color": "RED", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 100, "periodType": "CUSTOM" }

### Fechas CUSTOM en un budget NO-custom (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Bad dates", "color": "RED", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 100, "periodType": "MONTHLY", "periodStartDate": "2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z" }

### reference inválido (400 — ya no persiste claves corruptas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets?reference=basura
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Color inválido (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "X", "color": "amber-200", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 100, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }

### ==========================================================
### O-B1 — id del cliente (offline). Re-ejecutable: la segunda
### corrida responde 200 (replay) en vez de 201, sin volver a
### evaluar la regla de solapamiento.
### ==========================================================

### Crear con id propio (201 la primera vez, 200 el replay)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "019a0000-0b01-7000-8000-0000000000b1", "name": "Offline budget", "color": "GREEN", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 250, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }

### Replay idéntico (200)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "019a0000-0b01-7000-8000-0000000000b1", "name": "Offline budget", "color": "GREEN", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 250, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }

### Mismo id, monto distinto (409 ID_TAKEN, no BUDGET_PERIOD_OVERLAP)
POST {{baseUrl}}/budgets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "id": "019a0000-0b01-7000-8000-0000000000b1", "name": "Offline budget", "color": "GREEN", "categoryIds": ["{{catId}}"], "amount": 900, "periodType": "MONTHLY" }

### ==========================================================
### O-B2 — If-Match (concurrencia optimista). La guarda es el
### updatedAt del BUDGET, también para el override de monto.
### ==========================================================

### Leer el budget para quedarse con su updatedAt
# @name budgetForIfMatch
GET {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

@budgetVersion = {{budgetForIfMatch.response.body.updatedAt}}

### Editar con la versión correcta (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: {{budgetVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "note": "Editado con If-Match" }

### La misma versión otra vez (409 STALE_UPDATE; `current` trae la VISTA del budget)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: {{budgetVersion}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 999 }

### Override de monto con versión vieja (409 STALE_UPDATE)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}/amount
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: 2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount": 123 }

### Archivar con versión vieja (409 STALE_UPDATE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/budgets/{{budgetId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
If-Match: 2020-01-01T00:00:00.000Z
